solved","note":"官稱、群體或匿名指代待覆核，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0215","start":215,"end":217,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0222","start":222,"end":224,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0236","start":236,"end":238,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0242","start":242,"end":244,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0265","start":265,"end":267,"surface":"楚王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或匿名指代待覆核，不補未見姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0285","start":285,"end":287,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0299","start":299,"end":302,"surface":"丞相平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000692","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0315","start":315,"end":317,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0367","start":367,"end":369,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p004","text":"群臣以禮次侍。乃使太仆嬰與東牟侯興居清宮，奉天子法駕，迎于代邸。皇帝即日夕入未央宮。乃夜拜宋昌為衛將軍，鎮撫南北軍。以張武為郎中令，行殿中。還坐前殿。於是夜下詔書曰：「閒者諸呂用事擅權，謀為大逆，欲以危劉氏宗廟，賴將相列侯宗室大臣誅之，皆伏其辜。朕初即位，其赦天下，賜民爵一級，女子百戶牛酒，酺五日。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"太仆嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000887","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"興居","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000881","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000880","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p010","text":"三月，有司請立皇后。薄太后曰：「諸侯皆同姓，立太子母為皇后。」皇后姓竇氏。上為立后故，賜天下鰥寡孤獨窮困及年八十已上孤兒九歲已下布帛米肉各有數。上從代來，初即位，施德惠天下，填撫諸侯四夷皆洽驩，乃循從代來功臣。上曰：「方大臣之誅諸呂迎朕，朕狐疑，皆止朕，唯中尉宋昌勸朕，朕以得保奉宗廟。已尊昌為衛將軍，其封昌為壯武侯。諸從朕六人，官皆至九卿。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000888","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"薄太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000888","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000888","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"竇氏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000888","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000881","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000881","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000881","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-010","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi","source":{"title":"史記／卷010","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷010","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷010&oldid=2599229","revision_id":2599229,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文41個p區塊，自孝文皇帝至太史公論贊；排除前置跨站dd及末尾索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"泽":"澤","为":"為","绖":"絰"},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"正文均為p，排除sup註號，保留行內校勘符號。","note":"澤、為、絰僅作明記簡繁轉換；保留琅邪及古代異體，未核影像或可靠底本。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":true}}
